monsters that learn and evolve as they fight you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your skills to run, jump, dash, swim, fly, and stomp your way to victory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 stages of challenges, danger, and an obscene amount of spikes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304910/extras/eacd3cbbd4cd15050f25b035ebece7a6.poster.avif?t=1749610118\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304910/extras/eacd3cbbd4cd15050f25b035ebece7a6.webm?t=1749610118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304910/extras/eacd3cbbd4cd15050f25b035ebece7a6.mp4?t=1749610118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you've read this far you should also know: this game was entirely made by a single developer. Story, art, music, programming, design, everything in this game was made by a single person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304910/extras/488bc9492642dc8356afac803752e99d.poster.avif?t=1749610118\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304910/extras/488bc9492642dc8356afac803752e99d.webm?t=1749610118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304910/extras/488bc9492642dc8356afac803752e99d.mp4?t=1749610118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["lvl_0"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_im